  {
    "knowledge_point": {
      "db_id": 17592186087699,
      "id": "9b9ef325-2358-5041-8a8d-b459e8ed9f09",
      "title": "Determining the Inverse of a 2x2 Matrix"
    },
    "question": {
      ":question/id": "c0096ac2-79d4-5944-9296-1ccbe2080c9f",
      ":question/problem": "Consider the matrices\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{1}{3} & \\frac{1}{2} \\\\ -\\frac{1}{3} & \\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix},\\,B=\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{3}{2} & -\\frac{3}{2} \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{bmatrix},\\,C=\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{3}{2} & -\\frac{3}{2} \\\\ 1 & -1\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nI. $AB=BA={I}_{2}$\n\nII. $AC=CA={I}_{2}$\n\nIII. $C={A}^{-1}$\n\nSelect all that apply. If none apply, leave all boxes unchecked.",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/hard",
      ":question/worked-solution": "- First, we check whether $AB=BA={I}_{2}.$ Computing $AB$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AB & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{1}{3} & \\frac{1}{2} \\\\ -\\frac{1}{3} & \\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{3}{2} & -\\frac{3}{2} \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & ={I}_{2}.\\,\u2713\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLikewise, computing $BA$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}BA & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{3}{2} & -\\frac{3}{2} \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{1}{3} & \\frac{1}{2} \\\\ -\\frac{1}{3} & \\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & ={I}_{2}.\\,\u2713\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, statement I is true.\n\n- Now, we check whether $AC=CA={I}_{2}.$ Computing $AC$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AC & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{1}{3} & \\frac{1}{2} \\\\ -\\frac{1}{3} & \\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{3}{2} & -\\frac{3}{2} \\\\ 1 & -1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}\u2217 & -1 \\\\ \u2217 & \u2217\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & \\ne {I}_{2}.\\,\\times \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, statement II is false. As a result, $C\\ne {A}^{-1}$ and statement III is false too.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I only\".",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "5c1bc314-6a46-5431-a9ef-9b515af9d40a",
          ":answer-field/key": "I",
