  {
    "knowledge_point": {
      "db_id": 17592186087699,
      "id": "9b9ef325-2358-5041-8a8d-b459e8ed9f09",
      "title": "Determining the Inverse of a 2x2 Matrix"
    },
    "question": {
      ":question/id": "c4cdbd23-313e-5bed-a24a-ca724f48fda6",
      ":question/problem": "Consider the matrices\n$A = \\begin{bmatrix}1 & -\\frac{2}{3} \\\\ \\frac{1}{2} & \\frac{2}{3}\\end{bmatrix}, B = \\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{2}{3} & -\\frac{1}{2} \\\\ \\frac{2}{3} & 1\\end{bmatrix}, C = \\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{2}{3} & \\frac{2}{3} \\\\ -\\frac{1}{2} & 1\\end{bmatrix}$.\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\n1. $AB = BA = I_{2}$\n2. $AC = CA = I_{2}$\n3. $B = A^{-1}$",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/hard",
      ":question/worked-solution": "We must check whether each pair multiplies to $I_2$.\n\nComputing $AB$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AB & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -\\frac{2}{3} \\\\ \\frac{1}{2} & \\frac{2}{3}\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{2}{3} & -\\frac{1}{2} \\\\ \\frac{2}{3} & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{2}{9} & -\\frac{7}{6} \\\\ \\frac{7}{9} & \\frac{5}{12}\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nComputing $AC$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AC & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -\\frac{2}{3} \\\\ \\frac{1}{2} & \\frac{2}{3}\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{2}{3} & \\frac{2}{3} \\\\ -\\frac{1}{2} & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nComputing $CA$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}CA & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{2}{3} & \\frac{2}{3} \\\\ -\\frac{1}{2} & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -\\frac{2}{3} \\\\ \\frac{1}{2} & \\frac{2}{3}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II only\".",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "1e36592e-d8a6-5392-ae80-f519d5f3389e",
          ":answer-field/key": "selection",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/radio",
          ":answer-field/choices": [
            {
              ":answer/id": "a498c3b5-83c7-5ef8-a57e-a21e44cd7141",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "None"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "5dc41913-39dc-5f7b-886c-77642429db26",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "I only"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "5f779acd-9ca4-5ba0-9fd3-a8659174be05",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "I and III only"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "c1671944-2ab5-5037-bdb2-81ea9f7ee771",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "III only"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "591d1621-de6a-5ae4-b575-f011da352ede",
