      "db_id": 17592186087699,
      "id": "9b9ef325-2358-5041-8a8d-b459e8ed9f09",
      "title": "Determining the Inverse of a 2x2 Matrix"
    },
    "question": {
      ":question/id": "72e1e893-56e3-5255-bc50-eb47aa1724f5",
      ":question/problem": "Consider the matrices\n$A = \\begin{bmatrix}-\\frac{1}{3} & -\\frac{3}{2} \\\\ \\frac{2}{3} & 1\\end{bmatrix}, B = \\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{3}{2} & \\frac{9}{4} \\\\ -1 & \\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix}, C = \\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{3}{2} & \\frac{9}{4} \\\\ -1 & -\\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix}$.\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\n1. $AB = BA = I_{2}$\n2. $AC = CA = I_{2}$\n3. $B = A^{-1}$",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/hard",
      ":question/worked-solution": "We must check whether each pair multiplies to $I_2$.\n\nComputing $AB$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AB & =\\begin{bmatrix}-\\frac{1}{3} & -\\frac{3}{2} \\\\ \\frac{2}{3} & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{3}{2} & \\frac{9}{4} \\\\ -1 & \\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -\\frac{3}{2} \\\\ 0 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nComputing $AC$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AC & =\\begin{bmatrix}-\\frac{1}{3} & -\\frac{3}{2} \\\\ \\frac{2}{3} & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{3}{2} & \\frac{9}{4} \\\\ -1 & -\\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nComputing $CA$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}CA & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{3}{2} & \\frac{9}{4} \\\\ -1 & -\\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-\\frac{1}{3} & -\\frac{3}{2} \\\\ \\frac{2}{3} & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II only\".",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "3950b769-913f-503e-bb7b-bfbe27575d66",
          ":answer-field/key": "selection",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/radio",
          ":answer-field/choices": [
            {
              ":answer/id": "67aa9983-06ae-512d-b616-d63560e8eb90",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "II only"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "f3572b43-21f2-54de-90dc-6d281f318466",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "None"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "ce0f911b-c046-5fdc-b45a-31ab4cd9adde",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "III only"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "0276087f-189b-5356-a8a7-2a27166e1adc",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "I only"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "fdb70b93-211a-55f2-ade4-5aaea2406b43",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "I and III only"
            }
          ],
          ":answer-field/correct": [
            ":answer/id",
            "67aa9983-06ae-512d-b616-d63560e8eb90"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
