  {
    "knowledge_point": {
      "db_id": 17592186087699,
      "id": "9b9ef325-2358-5041-8a8d-b459e8ed9f09",
      "title": "Determining the Inverse of a 2x2 Matrix"
    },
    "question": {
      ":question/id": "09e8d955-55cd-5b5f-98b2-7dba294be287",
      ":question/problem": "Consider the matrices\n\n$$\nE=\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{3}{2} & \\frac{1}{3} \\\\ -\\frac{3}{2} & -1\\end{bmatrix},\\,F=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & \\frac{1}{3} \\\\ -\\frac{3}{2} & -\\frac{3}{2}\\end{bmatrix},\\,G=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -\\frac{3}{2} \\\\ \\frac{1}{3} & -\\frac{3}{2}\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** $EF=FE={I}_{2}$\n- **II.** $EG=GE={I}_{2}$\n- **III.** $G={E}^{-1}$",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/hard",
      ":question/worked-solution": "- First, we check whether $EF=FE={I}_{2}.$ Computing $EF$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}EF & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{3}{2} & \\frac{1}{3} \\\\ -\\frac{3}{2} & -1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}1 & \\frac{1}{3} \\\\ -\\frac{3}{2} & -\\frac{3}{2}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & ={I}_{2}.\\,\u2713\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLikewise, computing $FE$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}FE & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & \\frac{1}{3} \\\\ -\\frac{3}{2} & -\\frac{3}{2}\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{3}{2} & \\frac{1}{3} \\\\ -\\frac{3}{2} & -1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & ={I}_{2}.\\,\u2713\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, statement I is true.\n\n- Now, we check whether $EG=GE={I}_{2}.$ Computing $EG$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}EG & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{3}{2} & \\frac{1}{3} \\\\ -\\frac{3}{2} & -1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -\\frac{3}{2} \\\\ \\frac{1}{3} & -\\frac{3}{2}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{29}{18} & \u2217 \\\\ \u2217 & \u2217\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & \\ne {I}_{2}.\\,\\times \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, statement II is false. As a result, $G\\ne {E}^{-1}$ and statement III is false too.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I only\".",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "e7cbca81-291f-592d-ac6e-803603c45fec",
          ":answer-field/key": "I",
